[b]CSS v1.0.0-beta.10[/b]

[list]
[*]Fixed outfits reverting after gates and launchpads, including delayed resets.
[*]Fixed sidearm aiming breaking after game-driven mesh changes.
[*]Kept selected idle, walk, jog and sprint animations when carrying an outfit into Harbinger form.
[*]Fixed blocked appearance changes in Harbinger form.
[*]Use Enter to save a profile while typing its name. Invalid names now show a clearer message.
[*]Fixed overlapping status text in the SHELL tab.
[*]Added Heart of Vatra visibility to MISC.
[/list]

Close the game, extract into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep your [b]CustomShellSystem/state/[/b] folder.
